# This static landing page does not require runtime secrets.
# Keep Stripe secret keys out of the browser and out of this repository.
#
# If the site is later migrated to Next.js/server-side Stripe APIs, set these only in Vercel:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://preventivewealth.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_publishable_key
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key
